Cc: Lance Yang <lance.yang@linux.dev>
Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
---

 mm/migrate.c |    5 ++---
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

--- a/mm/migrate.c~mm-migrate-remove-migratepage_unmap-fix
+++ a/mm/migrate.c
